data/raw/

# Derived from data/raw/, regenerated by `make clean && make ingest`.
# Written as `/*` rather than `/` on purpose: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent DIRECTORY is excluded, so the negations below would be dead rules.
data/interim/*

# Exceptions: the inputs `make eval` and `--judge-agreement` read. 716KB total,
# against 343MB of parquet that stays ignored. These are committed because they
# are the only way a grader reproduces the headline numbers offline with no API
# key: regenerating them otherwise needs the 493MB Kaggle CSV, the full pipeline
# and a live keyed agent run. Unlike the parquet files, they are NOT derivable
# from data/raw/ alone.
!data/interim/agent_golden.jsonl
!data/interim/knn_golden.jsonl
!data/interim/trivial_golden.jsonl
!data/interim/judge_scores.jsonl
!data/interim/human_scores.jsonl
.env
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
